- nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3, nvidia/parakeet-tdt-1.1b, nvidia/parakeet-ctc-1.1b, nvidia/parakeet-tdt_ctc-110m (NVIDIA)
- moondream/parakeet-ultra (Moondream), a post-trained parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3; converted to NeMo by ultra_to_nemo.py

